Merged and Deployed: yes only if this exact change is merged or running in production, else no, or n/a; a false yes is worse. Delivery and Unblock only under a delivery standard; deployed but off by default is Deployed yes and Delivery off, with the blocker in Missing. Did: up to three sentences. Artifact: one per line; a file for the user is `file <absolute path>`. Verified: what you ran and its reading, or untested. Status: done when every criterion is met; what lies outside them goes in Missing. Missing: only what someone else must supply. Blocked: name who or what in Waiting. Write it in Japanese.